# Scene2-2-5

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐2‐5
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:11_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『娯楽室』を選択
; ========================================
; ========================================
; フィルムのまわる音
; @sfx Sfx_44
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms-
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:来到娱乐室，<br>米莉亚和安安正在放电影。|#0202Adv05_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们都看得聚精会神，<br>没有注意到我进来了。|#0202Adv05_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……<ruby=\"Peter Pan\">小飞侠</ruby>啊）|#0202Adv05_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我瞥了一眼银幕上的老电影，<br>便开始环顾室内。|#0202Adv05_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（如果要在这里杀死艾玛的话……）|#0202Adv05_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.2
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,3 Zoom:0.5 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:一抬头，大吊灯映入眼帘。|#0202Adv05_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（用这个大吊灯比较合适吧）|#0202Adv05_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:动一动手脚，让它砸到艾玛的头上——<br>也许就能伪装成事故。|#0202Adv05_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（问题是，我能完美伪装得<br>　不留下蛛丝马迹吗……）|#0202Adv05_Hiro004|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ぶんっと武器が振り下ろされる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_9 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1
@ModifyCamera Offset:0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.5 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:——嘿，呀～|#0202Adv05_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一声略显滑稽的喊声传来，<br>我不由得回头。|#0202Adv05_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:一看，<br>原来是米莉亚正在银幕前挥动台球杆。|#0202Adv05_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是在干什么……？）|#0202Adv05_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哒～……大概就像这样？<br>那个，安安，你觉得怎么样？|#0202Adv05_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来米莉亚是在模仿银幕里<br>挥剑的海盗。|#0202Adv05_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_05,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:"『下盘不稳，气势不足。<br>　你这样是无法胜任铁钩船长一角的』|#0202Adv05_AnAn001|" AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:什么！？嗯……<br>大叔我本来还挺有自信的呢……|#0202Adv05_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『只能说，要上台表演<br>　练习之路道阻且长』|#0202Adv05_AnAn002|" AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（原来如此，她们在研究舞台剧的事啊）|#0202Adv05_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你们在舞台剧组都负责什么？|#0202Adv05_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Surprised1,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1-Option-All

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，是希罗呀。<br>其实大叔我被提拔为铁钩船长了。|#0202Adv05_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Smile1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『吾辈负责剧本』|#0202Adv05_AnAn003| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和耷拉着脑袋的米莉亚相反，<br>安安得意洋洋地举起了素描本。|#0202Adv05_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:剧目已经定为《小飞侠》了，<br>我们刚在开研讨会呢。|#0202Adv05_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊。祝你们成功。|#0202Adv05_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，大叔我会努力的……|#0202Adv05_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:安安你那边怎样了。<br>剧本写得还顺利吗？|#0202Adv05_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『草案已经完稿』|#0202Adv05_AnAn004| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎，这就写完了？好厉害……|#0202Adv05_Miria008| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Flushed1,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1-Option-All

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0202Adv05_AnAn005| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我也会帮忙的，我们一起努力吧。|#0202Adv05_Miria009| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然超过这部电影的水平是不可能的啦……<br>但还是希望我们能创作出优秀的舞台剧来。|#0202Adv05_Miria010| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安重重地点了点头。<br>看来对于舞台剧一事，她们两人都很积极。|#0202Adv05_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……这么看，蕾雅的提议也不坏）<br>|#0202Adv05_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（有了目标以后，大家似乎都恢复了活力）<br>|#0202Adv05_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:说到小飞侠的名场面就是空中飘浮，<br>我们能用吊威亚之类的方法复现出来吗？|#0202Adv05_Miria011| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_05,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『如果能真的飞到空中就精彩了』|#0202Adv05_AnAn006| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……汉娜的魔法<br>不知道能不能让其他人也飘浮起来呢。|#0202Adv05_Miria012| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（还是别再继续打扰她们了）|#0202Adv05_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:趁着两人正热火朝天地讨论，<br>我转身离开了娱乐室。|#0202Adv05_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

